		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=27676#p27676"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,<br />Merci pour la réponse.<br />J&#039;ai fait:</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code># wget [url]https://ftp.postgresql.org/pub/source/v10.0/postgresql-10.0.tar.bz2[/url]

 tar -xvf postgresql-10.0.tar.bz2

./configure --prefix=/u02/app/PostgreSQL-10

#make

# make install
 
Postgresql 10 has been installed in /u02/app/PostgreSQL-10</code></pre></div><p>D&#039;avance merci.</p>]]></content>
